        "data": {
          "comment": "# Translate a Script for Dubbing\n\nTranslates a spoken script into the language you name, keeping each sentence close to the original length. The new voice track then fits the same footage.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Script\" and \"2 Language\" fill the template in \"3 Prompt\". \"4 Agent\" writes the translation with the model chosen in \"Language model\", following a system prompt for natural, length-matched speech. \"5 Output\" returns only the translated script.\n\n**Try this:** Set \"2 Language\" to Japanese or German and compare sentence lengths against \"1 Script\"."
        },
